==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 80~100 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lollycat (Enemy)|Lollycat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 46.67~60 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
One strategy is to use [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]], and, although optional, an [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal Cat]] (e.g., [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Major Space Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]]). [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel Cats]] are not needed, but could be used.

In the beginning, use only Wall Cats to block the peons from the [[Cat Base]]. Upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to Level 4, but use Paris Cats to kill enemies if they start to push through your Wall Cats. Once your Worker Cat is at Level 4, you can either Continue to upgrade Worker Cat to Level 8 and wait for maximum money or start sending out Wall Cats, Paris Cats, Dragon Cats and the Anti-Metal Cats.

When your Cats hit the half-way point, start sending out Macho Cats to accompany them. The Lollycat will appear when the enemy base hits the 495,000 mark.

The Lollycat doesn't hit as hard as most other Awakened Enemies, but he attacks fast with a long range. Keep sending out meatshields to prevent the enemies from pushing, and use Paris Cats for damage. The real threats are the [[Metal Hippoe]]s (if you didn't bring an Anti-Metal Cat), the [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s and the [[Gabriel]]s. If you're getting extra money from killing the enemies, save up for True Valkyrie Cat, but do not stop sending out Macho and Wall Cats.

